%% MUPP-036 Onboarding dialog: one button and a scroll cue
flowchart TD
    A[Dialog opens or the tab changes] --> B{More text below the visible part?}
    B -- yes --> C[Arrow Läs vidare, R2]
    C -- pressed --> D[Panel scrolls down] --> B
    B -- no --> E[OK, R1]
    E -- pressed, or Esc, or a press outside --> F[Dialog closes]
